		{
			dependencies: ["1FCDA02A8AF6F019"]
			description: ["Right-click the note block upstairs to call the next wave. Nothing comes until you do, with one catch: after each clear a timer starts (10 minutes minimum), and when it runs out the wave comes on its own. Use the gap to repair, restock and build. Then sound it."]
