		{
			dependencies: ["7F675AEBC7301832"]
			description: ["Every mob down means the wave is cleared, the timer to the next one starts, and the border grows: 5 blocks a wave for waves 1 to 3, 10 a wave for waves 4 to 6, 15 for 7 to 9, and 5 more every three waves after that. More ground to hold, and more ground to loot."]
