		{
			dependencies: ["0CBAE9737A4869E9"]
			description: ["Any wave mob can drop a loot bag when it dies, and every one of them rolls the same odds: 20% for an &eUncommon&r bag, 3.5% Rare, 3% Epic, 2% Legendary. Tougher mobs don't carry better bags; they're just harder to kill. Kill count is what pays."]
