		{
			dependencies: ["0CBAE9737A4869E9"]
			description: [
				"The pedestal can be made tougher, and you pay in &eXP levels&r. Right-click the pedestal with an empty hand to open its upgrade screen (&e/pedestal&r opens it too). Three upgrades, three tiers each: &eMax HP&r (300 up to 600), &eArmor&r (up to 45% less damage) and &eThorns&r (up to 3 damage a second back at everything hitting it). Tiers cost 6, 12 and 18 levels."
				"One player pays a tier's whole cost from their own levels - levels can't be pooled - but the upgrade belongs to the pedestal, so everyone benefits. After a wave clears, players who can afford a tier get an &a[Upgrades]&r link in chat."
			]
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
			icon: "minecraft:experience_bottle"
