		{
			dependencies: ["538A1BBC9A1B8EAC"]
			description: [
				"The &eAmulet&r can't be crafted. Carry eight gold ingots, open this quest and click the task to hand them in, and the amulet is your reward. Each player claims their own. Gold comes as ingots from Rare bags or nuggets from Uncommon ones, nine to an ingot."
				"It goes in the Curios necklace slot in your inventory, not an armour slot. Fire and lava won't destroy it, but &cit's the only one you'll get&r, so don't lose it."
